                  <zone forceUpdate='true' h='6175' id='127' type-v2='text' w='74333' x='25000' y='8492'>
                    <formatted-text>
                      <run bold='true' fontcolor='#898989' fontsize='8'>- Dashboard shows the total count of countries where metrics are available compared to number of countries where DH is the leader in that metric. </run>
                      <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                      <run bold='true' fontcolor='#898989' fontsize='8'>- Competition metrics will always lag 1 week compared to internal metrics. </run>
                      <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                      <run bold='true' fontcolor='#898989' fontsize='8'>- In the case of 3rd party data not being available, the total count of countries will be 0 as well. - Null countires are excluded.</run>
