                  <zone h='1283' id='122' type-v2='text' w='56868' x='42599' y='98543'>
                    <formatted-text>
                      <run fontcolor='#555555' italic='true'>- Numbers in the box represent the ratio: DH divided by top competition</run>
                      <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                      <run fontcolor='#555555' italic='true'>- On top of each region, you see the number of leading countries/Total countries</run>
